00:04:21.799 --> 00:04:26.640
Then, you keep borrowing and include

00:04:24.919 --> 00:04:28.360
from the bank what we'll call

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:31.560
accumulating

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:33.760
asset payments until you die.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:35.800
And you borrow continuously, and then

